        "dev_team": "Netease",
        "rule_contributors": [
          "Absinthe"
        ],
        "description": "IM SDK is the foundation for NetEase Cloud Communication's other capabilities (real-time voice and video, interactive whiteboard, etc.). This section describes the integration steps of the IM SDK, which also incorporate the integration steps of other capability SDKs, allowing developers to choose the libraries to access based on actual business needs.",
